In this episode of Build With Me, I build a complete image-to-image (img2img) workflow in ComfyUI from a blank canvas — no imports, no templates, just nodes. We're using Z-Image Turbo and I walk you through every single node, what it does, and why it's there.
 
You'll learn the difference between text-to-image and img2img, how VAE Encode replaces Empty Latent Image, and most importantly — how the denoise value controls how much your reference photo influences the output vs. how much your prompt takes over.
 
If you've ever wanted to take a real photo and use AI to modify, stylize, or reimagine it — this is where it starts.
 
